					${festHtml}${peopleHtml}${workHtml}${homeHtml}${expHtml}${vanHtml}<div class="list">${acts}</div>${courseHtml}${shopHtml}${dealerHtml}${propHtml}${poiHtml}`;
			}

			function panelGo() {
				const s = state!;
				const opts = travelOptions(s, region);
				const note = selected && selected !== s.loc && !opts.some((o) => o.to === selected)
					? `<p class="muted">从这里没有直达${esc(getLocation(region, selected)!.name)}的路线，需要中转。</p>` : '';
				const rows = opts.map((o) => {
					const to = getLocation(region, o.to)!;
					const h = Math.floor(o.minutes / 60), m = o.minutes % 60;
					return `<button class="row${selected === o.to ? ' sel' : ''}" data-go="${o.to}" data-mode="${o.mode}" ${o.available ? '' : 'disabled'}>
						<span class="ico">${KIND_ICON[to.kind]}</span>
						<span class="body">${esc(to.name)}${s.visited[o.to] ? '' : ' 🆕'}<small>${o.label} · ${o.km} km${o.reason ? ' · ' + esc(o.reason) : ''}</small></span>
						<span class="meta">$${o.cost}<br/>${h ? h + ' 小时 ' : ''}${m} 分</span></button>`;
				}).join('');
				return `${note}<div class="list">${rows}</div><p class="muted">点地图上的地点可以高亮对应路线。虚线是航班，长虚线是越野土路（需四驱）。</p>`;
			}

			function panelMe() {
				const s = state!;
				const origin = ORIGINS.find((o) => o.id === s.origin)!;
				const skills = SKILL_KEYS.map((k) => `<div class="skill"><span>${SKILL_META[k].icon}</span><div>${SKILL_META[k].name} <span class="muted">${SKILL_META[k].hint}</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:${s.skills[k]}%"></i></div></div><b title="含特质、装备、心情的检定分">${checkScore(s, k).total}</b></div>`).join('');
				const vdef = getVehicle(s.vehicle);
				const veh = vdef ? `${vdef.icon} ${vdef.name}（值 $${resaleValue(vdef.id).toLocaleString()}）` : '无（坐巴士）';
				const titles = areaTitles(s);
				const album = Object.entries(AREAS).map(([id, a]) => {
					const all = EXPERIENCES.filter((e) => e.area === id);
					const got = all.filter((e) => s.collected.includes(e.id));
					return `<div class="row" style="margin-top:6px"><span class="body">${esc(a.name)} ${got.length}/${all.length}<small>${all.map((e) => (s.collected.includes(e.id) ? '✅' : '⬜') + esc(e.name)).join(' · ')}</small></span></div>`;
				}).join('');
				const lv = level(s.respect);
				const m = mood(s);
				const tier = moodTier(m);
				const mb = moodBreakdown(s);
				const traits = s.traits.map((id) => getTrait(id)).filter(Boolean).map((t) => `<span class="tag" title="${esc(t!.desc)}">${esc(t!.name)}</span>`).join('');
				const jc = s.job ? getCareer(s.job.career) : undefined;
				const promo = promotionStatus(s);
				const hd = s.home ? getHome(s.home.type) : undefined;
				const wc = weeklyCosts(s);
				const estate = s.properties.map((op) => {
					const pr = getProperty(op.id);
					if (!pr) return '';
					const living = s.home?.owned === op.id;
					const status = living ? '自住' : op.rented ? `出租中 +$${pr.rentIncome}/周` : '空置';
					return `<div style="margin-top:10px"><div class="row"><span class="body">${esc(pr.name)} · ${esc(getLocation(region, pr.loc)!.name)}<small>${status} · 物业费 $${pr.weekly}/周${op.loan ? ` · 贷款 $${op.loan.toLocaleString()}，每周还 $${loanPayment(pr, op.loan)}` : ' · 无贷款'}${op.missed ? ` · ⚠️ 已欠款 ${op.missed} 次（超过 ${FINANCE.graceWeeks} 次强制卖房）` : ''}</small></span><span class="meta">卖出到手<br/>$${saleProceeds(pr, op.loan).toLocaleString()}</span></div>
					<div class="inline" style="margin-top:6px;flex-wrap:wrap">${living ? '' : `<button data-prop="movein" data-prop-id="${op.id}">搬进去</button>`}<button data-prop="rentout" data-prop-id="${op.id}">${op.rented ? '停止出租' : '出租'}</button>${op.loan ? `<button data-prop="repay" data-prop-id="${op.id}">提前还贷</button>` : ''}<button data-prop="sell" data-prop-id="${op.id}">卖掉</button></div></div>`;
				}).join('');
				const life = `
					<p>${jc ? `${esc(jc.name)}（${esc(getLocation(region, s.job!.loc)!.name)}）· ${esc(jc.levels[s.job!.level].title)} · 每班 $${jc.levels[s.job!.level].pay}` : '无业。到城镇、海滩、矿区等地方找工作。'}</p>
					${promo ? `<p>升职到${esc(promo.next.title)}：已上 ${promo.shifts}/${PROMOTE_SHIFTS} 班，表现好 ${promo.good}/${PROMOTE_GOOD} 班${promo.blocked ? `，还需${esc(promo.blocked)}` : ''}</p>` : jc ? '<p>已是最高职位。</p>' : ''}
					<p>${hd ? `住在${esc(getLocation(region, s.home!.loc)!.name)}的${esc(hd.name)}，家具：${Object.values(s.home!.furniture).map((id) => esc(getFurniture(id)?.name ?? '')).join('、') || '无'}` : '没有住处。在城镇可以租房，回家睡觉免费且恢复更多。'}</p>
					<p>每周固定开销 $${wc.total}${wc.total ? `（房租 $${wc.rent} + 车辆 $${wc.vehicle} + 房产 $${wc.property}）· ${Math.max(0, s.nextWeek - dayOf(s.clock))} 天后结算` : ''}</p>
					<div class="inline" style="margin-top:8px">${jc ? '<button data-job="quit">辞职</button>' : ''}${hd ? '<button data-home="leave">退租</button>' : ''}</div>`;
				const rels = Object.entries(s.relations).map(([id, r]) => {
					const npc = NPCS.find((n) => n.id === id);
					if (!npc) return '';
					const plan = npcPlan(npc, s.clock);
					const where = `今天在${getLocation(region, plan.loc)?.name ?? ''} ${hoursLabel(plan.hours)}`;
					const known = r.known.map((i) => `${getItem(i)?.icon ?? ''}${GIFT_LABEL[giftReaction(npc, i)]}`).join(' ');
					return `<div class="skill"><span></span><div>${esc(npc.name)} <span class="muted">${esc(npc.role)} · ${esc(where)} · 故事 ${r.seen.length}/${npc.stories.length}${known ? ` · ${esc(known)}` : ''}</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:${Math.max(0, r.score)}%"></i></div></div><b title="${relationTier(r.score)}">${relationTier(r.score)}</b></div>`;
				}).join('');
				const bag = Object.entries(s.inventory).map(([id, n]) => {
					const it = getItem(id);
					if (!it) return '';
					return `<div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><span class="ico">${it.icon}</span><span class="body">${esc(it.name)} ×${n}<small>${esc(it.desc)}</small></span>${it.use ? `<button data-use="${it.id}">使用</button>` : '<span class="meta">装备中</span>'}</div>`;
				}).join('');
				return `<div class="card"><h3>${s.avatar} ${esc(s.name)}</h3><p>${origin.icon} ${origin.name} · 座驾：${veh}</p>
					<p>已探索 ${Object.keys(s.visited).length}/${region.locations.length} 个地点 · 麻烦值 ${Math.round(s.heat)}/100（${wantedStars(s.heat)} 星）</p>
						<p>Lv${lv.lv} ${lv.title} · 声望 ${Math.floor(s.respect)}${lv.next !== null ? ` / ${lv.next}` : ''} · 心情 ${m}（${tier.name}，检定 ${tier.check >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${tier.check}）</p>
						<div class="tags">${traits || '<span class="muted">没有性格特质</span>'}</div></div>
					<div class="card"><h3>心情 ${mb.total}（${tier.name}，检定 ${tier.check >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${tier.check}）</h3>
						<div style="margin-top:6px">
							<div class="mood-row"><span>生活需求（最低的一项拉低整体）</span><b>${mb.needs}</b></div>
							${mb.traits ? `<div class="mood-row"><span>性格特质</span><b class="${mb.traits > 0 ? 'up' : 'down'}">${mb.traits > 0 ? '+' : ''}${mb.traits}</b></div>` : ''}
							${mb.home ? `<div class="mood-row"><span>住处</span><b class="up">+${mb.home}</b></div>` : ''}
							${mb.moodlets.map((x) => `<div class="mood-row"><span>${x.def.icon} ${esc(x.def.name)} <span class="muted">还剩 ${x.minutesLeft >= 120 ? Math.round(x.minutesLeft / 60) + ' 小时' : Math.max(1, Math.round(x.minutesLeft)) + ' 分钟'}</span></span><b class="${x.def.value > 0 ? 'up' : 'down'}">${x.def.value > 0 ? '+' : ''}${x.def.value}</b></div>`).join('')}
						</div>
						${mb.moodlets.length ? '' : '<p style="margin-top:6px">做点开心的事——好好吃一顿、睡个好觉、完成心愿、去新地方——会留下几小时到几天的好心情。</p>'}
					</div>
					<div class="card"><h3>每日奖励</h3><p>已连续上线 ${s.daily.streak} 天。每天第一次上线领取，连续越久越多（$${DAILY.base} 起，第 ${DAILY.cap} 天另加 $${DAILY.bonus}），断一天从头算。</p></div>
					<div class="card"><h3>资产 · 净值 $${netWorth(s).toLocaleString()}</h3><p>现金 $${s.cash.toLocaleString()}${vdef ? ` · ${esc(vdef.name)} $${resaleValue(vdef.id).toLocaleString()}` : ''}${furnitureValue(s) ? ` · 家具 $${furnitureValue(s)}` : ''}</p>${estate || '<p>还没有房产。在卡尔古利、珀斯、弗里曼特尔、玛格丽特河可以买房。</p>'}</div>
					<div class="card"><h3>收藏册 ${s.collected.length}/${EXPERIENCES.length}</h3>${titles.length ? `<div class="tags">${titles.map((t) => `<span class="tag">🏅 ${esc(t)}</span>`).join('')}</div>` : '<p>在各地体验收费项目，集齐一个片区可获得称号。</p>'}${album}</div>
					<div class="card"><h3>工作与住处</h3>${life}</div>
					<div class="card"><h3>人际关系</h3>${rels || '<p>还没认识什么人。去各地看看谁在那里。</p>'}</div>
					<div class="card"><h3>背包</h3>${bag || '<p>空的。在地点页的商店里买东西。</p>'}</div>
					<div class="card"><h3>能力</h3><p>用得越多涨得越快。</p>${skills}</div>
					<div class="card"><h3>派生属性</h3>${(() => {
						const d = derivedStats(s);
						return `<p>体质 ${d.fitness}（体能 50% + 力量 30% + 游泳 20%）</p>
							<p>吸引力 ${d.appeal}（魅力 + 体质 15% + 心情修正${s.needs.hygiene < 30 ? ' − 邋遢 10' : ''}）</p>
							<p>体力消耗 ×${d.exertion} · 恢复 ×${d.recovery}</p>
							<p>状态系数 ×${d.efficiency.total}（心情 ×${d.efficiency.mood} · 健康 ×${d.efficiency.health} · 疲劳 ×${d.efficiency.fatigue}），训练收益和工作表现都乘它</p>`;
					})()}</div>`;
			}

			function panelSocial() {
				const s = state!;
				const online = ws?.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN;
				const here = [...peers.values()].filter((p) => p.loc === s.loc && p.id !== myPeerId);
				const people = here.length ? here.map((p) => `<div class="row"><span class="ico">${esc(p.avatar)}</span><span class="body">${esc(p.name)}</span>
					<span class="emotes">${emotes.map((e) => `<button data-emote="${e}" data-to="${esc(p.id)}">${e}</button>`).join(' ')}</span></div>`).join('') : '<p class="muted">这里暂时只有你一个人。</p>';
				return `<div class="card"><h3>${esc(getLocation(region, s.loc)!.name)}的人</h3><p>${online ? `全区在线 ${peers.size} 人` : '未连接，稍后自动重连…'}</p><div class="list" style="margin-top:8px">${people}</div></div>
					<div class="card"><h3>本地频道</h3><p>只有同一地点的玩家能看到。</p>
						<div class="chat" id="chat">${chats.map((c) => `<div>${esc(c.avatar)} <b>${esc(c.name)}</b> ${esc(c.text)}</div>`).join('')}</div>
						<form class="inline" id="chat-form"><input id="chat-input" maxlength="120" placeholder="说点什么…" autocomplete="off" ${online ? '' : 'disabled'} /><button class="primary" ${online ? '' : 'disabled'}>发送</button></form></div>`;
			}

			function panelLog() {
				const rows = [...state!.journal].reverse().map((j) => `<div class="row"><span class="body">${esc(j.text)}<small>${formatClock(j.t)}</small></span></div>`).join('');
				return `<div class="card"><h3>人生日志</h3><div class="list" style="margin-top:8px">${rows}</div></div>`;
			}

			function panelNear() {
				const s = state!;
				const intro = `<div class="card"><h3>附近能做的事</h3><p>人在真实的餐馆、健身房、公园、图书馆、超市……打开定位，就能在游戏里吃饭、训练、打卡上班。服务端会检查定位精度、距离和移动速度。</p>
					<div class="inline" style="margin-top:8px"><button data-locate>📍 ${nearFix ? '重新定位' : '定位'}</button></div>
					${nearFix ? `<p style="margin-top:6px" class="muted">定位误差约 ${Math.round(nearFix.acc)} 米 · ${Math.max(0, Math.round((Date.now() - nearFix.at) / 60000))} 分钟前</p>` : ''}</div>`;
				const ci = s.clockIn;
				const ciVenue = ci ? region.venues.find((v) => v.id === ci.venue) : undefined;
				const clockHtml = ci ? `<div class="card"><h3>💼 上班中</h3><p>${esc(ciVenue?.name ?? ci.venue)} · 已 ${Math.max(0, Math.round((Date.now() - ci.at) / 60000))} 分钟。${clockStale(s, Date.now()) ? '这张卡太久没打下班卡，已经过期：在任何能上班的地点点一下就会作废。' : `离开前在那里打下班卡（至少 ${FIX_RULES.clockInMinMin} 分钟，一次最多计 ${FIX_RULES.shiftMaxMin / 60} 小时）。`}</p></div>` : '';
				if (!region.venues.length) return intro + clockHtml + '<div class="card"><p>这个区域的真实地点数据还在采集中（来自 OpenStreetMap）。</p></div>';
				if (!nearFix) return intro + clockHtml;
				const list = venuesNear(s, region, nearFix.lat, nearFix.lon, nearFix.acc, Date.now());
				if (!list.length) return intro + clockHtml + '<div class="card"><p>1.5 公里内没有收录的地点。</p></div>';
				const cards = list.slice(0, 20).map(({ venue, type, distM, inRange, ops }) => `<div class="card"><h3>${type.icon} ${esc(venue.name)} <span class="muted">${esc(type.name)} · ${distM} 米</span></h3>
					${inRange ? ops.map(({ op, outcome, blocked, voids }) => {
						const clockOut = op.id === 'work' && s.clockIn?.venue === venue.id;
						const label = op.id === 'work' ? (voids ? '作废过期的上班卡' : clockOut ? '打下班卡' : '打上班卡') : op.name;
						const detail = blocked ?? (voids ? `${voids}，打不了新卡` : outcome ? outcome.notes.join(' · ') : op.desc);
						return `<button class="row" data-venue="${esc(venue.id)}" data-venue-op="${op.id}" ${blocked ? 'disabled' : ''}><span class="ico">${op.icon}</span><span class="body">${label}<small>${esc(detail)}</small></span></button>`;
					}).join('') : `<p>再走近 ${Math.max(0, distM - type.radiusM)} 米就能${ops.map((o) => o.op.name).join('、')}。</p>`}</div>`).join('');
				return intro + clockHtml + cards;
			}

			function panelSync() {
				return `<div class="card"><h3>多设备同步</h3><p>${esc(syncStatus)}</p>
						<p style="margin-top:8px">在另一台手机或电脑打开本页，选择“用同步码恢复”，粘贴下面这串码即可接着玩。</p>
						<div class="code">${esc(cred!.id)}.${esc(cred!.key)}</div>
						<div class="inline"><button data-copy>复制同步码</button><button data-pull>立即同步</button></div>
						<p style="margin-top:8px">同步码等同于密码，不要发给别人。</p></div>
					<div class="card"><h3>重新开始</h3><p>清除本机存档并创建新角色（云端旧档仍可用同步码找回）。</p><button data-reset style="margin-top:8px">删除本机存档</button></div>`;
			}

			function renderPanel() {
				$('tabs').innerHTML = TABS.map(([id, label]) => `<button data-tab="${id}" class="${tab === id ? 'on' : ''}">${label}</button>`).join('');
				const html = { place: panelPlace, near: panelNear, go: panelGo, me: panelMe, social: panelSocial, log: panelLog, sync: panelSync }[tab]!();
				$('panel').innerHTML = html;
				const chat = document.getElementById('chat');
				if (chat) chat.scrollTop = chat.scrollHeight;
			}

			function renderEvent() {
				const ev = state ? getPendingEvent(state) : null;
				const modal = $('modal');
				if (!ev) { modal.classList.add('hidden'); return; }
				const s = state!;
				modal.innerHTML = `<div class="sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">${hero('event:' + ev.id, ev.icon)}
					<h2>${ev.icon} ${esc(ev.title)}</h2><p>${esc(ev.text)}</p>
					<div class="list">${ev.choices.map((c, i) => `<button class="row" data-choice="${i}"${c.cost && c.cost > s.cash ? ' disabled' : ''}><span class="body">${esc(c.label)}${c.cost && c.cost > s.cash ? `<small>需要 $${c.cost}，钱不够</small>` : ''}${c.check ? `<small>${SKILL_META[c.check.skill].icon} ${SKILL_META[c.check.skill].name}检定（你 ${checkScore(s, c.check.skill).total} + 随机 0–60 / 难度 ${c.check.dc}）</small>` : ''}</span></button>`).join('')}</div></div>`;
				modal.classList.remove('hidden');
			}

			function render() {
				if (!state) { $('game').classList.add('hidden'); $('create').classList.remove('hidden'); return; }
				$('create').classList.add('hidden');
				$('game').classList.remove('hidden');
				renderHud();
				renderMap();
				renderPanel();
				renderEvent();
				if (dailyNote) {
					const note = dailyNote;
					dailyNote = '';
					setTimeout(() => toast('🎁 ' + note), 400);
				}
			}

			// ---------- 输入 ----------
			document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
				const t = (e.target as Element).closest<HTMLElement>('[data-tab],[data-act],[data-go],[data-loc],[data-choice],[data-gps],[data-locate],[data-venue],[data-emote],[data-copy],[data-pull],[data-reset],[data-buy],[data-use],[data-npc],[data-job],[data-home],[data-veh],[data-course],[data-exp],[data-furn],[data-prop]');
				if (!t || !state || (t as HTMLButtonElement).disabled) return;
				const d = t.dataset;
				if (d.tab) { tab = d.tab; renderPanel(); }
				else if (d.npc && d.npcAct) act(d.npcItem ? { t: 'npc', npc: d.npc, act: 'gift', item: d.npcItem } : { t: 'npc', npc: d.npc, act: d.npcAct as NpcAction }).then((r) => { if (r) { lastOutcome = r.msg; toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				else if (d.veh) {
					if (d.veh === 'sell' && !confirm('确定把车卖掉？')) return;
					const a: GameAction = d.veh === 'buy' ? { t: 'vehicle', op: 'buy', id: d.vehId! } : { t: 'vehicle', op: d.veh as 'sell' | 'sleep' };
					act(a).then((r) => { if (r) { lastOutcome = r.msg; toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				}
				else if (d.course) act({ t: 'course', id: d.course }).then((r) => { if (r) { lastOutcome = r.msg; toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				else if (d.exp) act({ t: 'experience', id: d.exp }).then((r) => { if (r) { lastOutcome = r.msg; toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				else if (d.job) {
					if (d.job === 'quit' && !confirm('确定辞职？当前等级的进度会清零。')) return;
					const a: GameAction = d.job === 'apply' ? { t: 'job', op: 'apply', career: d.career! } : { t: 'job', op: d.job as 'work' | 'quit' };
					act(a).then((r) => { if (r) { lastOutcome = r.msg; toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				}
				else if (d.prop) {
					const id = d.propId!;
					const pr = getProperty(id);
					if (!pr) return;
					let a: GameAction;
					if (d.prop === 'buy' || d.prop === 'buyloan') {
						if (!confirm(`确定${d.prop === 'buy' ? '全款' : '贷款'}买下${pr.name}？以后卖出只能拿回房价的 95%。`)) return;
						a = { t: 'property', op: 'buy', id, loan: d.prop === 'buyloan' };
					} else if (d.prop === 'repay') {
						const amount = Number(prompt('提前还多少？', String(Math.min(state.cash, state.properties.find((x) => x.id === id)?.loan ?? 0))));
						if (!(amount > 0)) return;
						a = { t: 'property', op: 'repay', id, amount };
					} else {
						if (d.prop === 'sell' && !confirm(`确定卖掉${pr.name}？`)) return;
						if (d.prop === 'movein' && state.home && !confirm('搬进去会退掉现在的住处，家具半价折现。确定？')) return;
						a = { t: 'property', op: d.prop as 'sell' | 'movein' | 'rentout', id };
					}
					act(a).then((r) => { if (r) { lastOutcome = r.msg; toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				}
				else if (d.furn) {
					const a: GameAction = d.furn === 'buy' ? { t: 'furniture', op: 'buy', id: d.furnId! } : { t: 'furniture', op: 'sell', slot: d.slot! };
					act(a).then((r) => { if (r) { toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				}
				else if (d.home) {
					if (d.home === 'leave' && !confirm('确定退租？已付的房租不退，家具半价折现。')) return;
					if (d.home === 'rent' && state.home && !confirm('搬家会退掉现在的住处，家具半价折现。确定？')) return;
					const a: GameAction = d.home === 'rent' ? { t: 'home', op: 'rent', home: d.homeId! } : { t: 'home', op: d.home as 'sleep' | 'leave' | 'cook' | 'relax' };
					act(a).then((r) => { if (r) { lastOutcome = r.msg; toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				}
				else if (d.buy) act({ t: 'buy', item: d.buy }).then((r) => { if (r) { toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				else if (d.use) act({ t: 'use', item: d.use }).then((r) => { if (r) { toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				else if (d.act) act({ t: 'activity', id: d.act }).then((r) => { if (r) { lastOutcome = null; toast(r.msg); render(); } });
				else if (d.go) {
					act({ t: 'travel', to: d.go, mode: d.mode as TravelMode }).then((r) => { if (r) { selected = null; lastOutcome = null; tab = 'place'; if (!state!.pending) toast(r.msg); render(); window.scrollTo({ top: 0 }); } });
				}
				else if (d.loc) { selected = d.loc === state.loc ? null : d.loc; tab = selected ? 'go' : 'place'; renderMap(); renderPanel(); }
				else if (d.choice) act({ t: 'event', choice: +d.choice }).then((r) => { if (r) { lastOutcome = r.msg; tab = 'place'; render(); } });
				else if ('gps' in d) checkIn();
				else if ('locate' in d) locate().then((f) => { if (f) renderPanel(); });
				else if (d.venue && d.venueOp) venueDo(d.venue, d.venueOp as VenueOp);
				else if (d.emote && d.to) { ws?.send(JSON.stringify({ t: 'emote', to: d.to, kind: d.emote })); toast(`你向对方 ${d.emote}`); }
				else if ('copy' in d) navigator.clipboard?.writeText(`${cred!.id}.${cred!.key}`).then(() => toast('已复制'), () => toast('复制失败，请长按手动复制'));
				else if ('pull' in d) pullCloud();
				else if ('reset' in d) {
					if (!confirm('确定删除本机存档？请先记下同步码。')) return;
					try { localStorage.removeItem(SAVE_KEY); localStorage.removeItem(CRED_KEY); } catch {}
					location.reload();
				}
			});
			document.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
				if ((e.target as Element).id !== 'chat-form') return;
				e.preventDefault();
				const input = $('chat-input') as HTMLInputElement;
				const text = input.value.trim();
				if (text && ws?.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) ws.send(JSON.stringify({ t: 'chat', text }));
				input.value = '';
			});

			/** 取一次高精度定位，存在本机内存里（不写 localStorage） */
			function locate(): Promise<typeof nearFix> {
				if (!navigator.geolocation) { toast('这台设备不支持定位'); return Promise.resolve(null); }
				toast('正在定位…');
				return new Promise((done) => navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(
					(pos) => { nearFix = { lat: pos.coords.latitude, lon: pos.coords.longitude, acc: pos.coords.accuracy, at: Date.now() }; done(nearFix); },
					() => { toast('无法获取定位，请检查定位权限'); done(null); },
					{ enableHighAccuracy: true, timeout: 10000, maximumAge: 0 },
				));
			}

			/** 真实地点动作：先重新定位；游戏里不在那个地点时先用真实定位抵达 */
			async function venueDo(venueId: string, op: VenueOp) {
				const v = region.venues.find((x) => x.id === venueId);
				if (!v || !getVenueType(v.type)) return;
				const f = await locate();
				if (!f || !state) return;
				if (state.loc !== v.loc) {
					const g = await act({ t: 'gps', lat: f.lat, lon: f.lon });
					if (!g || state.pending) { render(); return; }
				}
				const r = await act({ t: 'venue', venue: venueId, op, lat: f.lat, lon: f.lon, acc: f.acc });
				if (r) { lastOutcome = r.msg; toast(r.msg); }
				render();
			}

			function checkIn() {
				if (!navigator.geolocation) return toast('这台设备不支持定位');
				toast('正在定位…');
				navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(
					(pos) => {
						if (!state) return;
						act({ t: 'gps', lat: pos.coords.latitude, lon: pos.coords.longitude }).then((r) => { if (r) { if (!state!.pending) toast(r.msg); render(); } });
					},
					() => toast('无法获取定位，请检查定位权限'),
					{ enableHighAccuracy: true, timeout: 10000 },
				);
			}

			// ---------- 创建角色 ----------
			let pickAvatar = AVATARS[0];
			let pickOrigin = ORIGINS[0].id;
			let pickTraits: string[] = [];
			function renderCreate() {
				$('c-avatars').innerHTML = AVATARS.map((a) => `<button class="chip${a === pickAvatar ? ' on' : ''}" data-avatar="${a}">${a}</button>`).join('');
				$('c-origins').innerHTML = ORIGINS.map((o) => `<button class="origin${o.id === pickOrigin ? ' on' : ''}" data-origin="${o.id}">${o.icon} ${o.name} · 起始 $${o.cash}${o.vehicle !== 'none' ? ' · 有车' : ''}<small>${o.desc}</small></button>`).join('');
				$('c-traits').innerHTML = TRAITS.map((t) => {
					const on = pickTraits.includes(t.id);
					const ok = on || validTraits([...pickTraits, t.id], MAX_TRAITS);
					return `<button class="trait${on ? ' on' : ''}" data-trait="${t.id}" ${ok ? '' : 'disabled'}>${esc(t.name)}<small>${esc(t.desc)}</small></button>`;
				}).join('');
				($('c-start') as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = pickTraits.length !== MAX_TRAITS;
				$('c-start').textContent = pickTraits.length === MAX_TRAITS ? '开始生活' : `再选 ${MAX_TRAITS - pickTraits.length} 个性格特质`;
			}
			$('create').addEventListener('click', (e) => {
				const t = (e.target as Element).closest<HTMLElement>('[data-avatar],[data-origin],[data-trait]');
				if (!t || (t as HTMLButtonElement).disabled) return;
				if (t.dataset.avatar) pickAvatar = t.dataset.avatar;
				if (t.dataset.origin) pickOrigin = t.dataset.origin;
				const tr = t.dataset.trait;
				if (tr) pickTraits = pickTraits.includes(tr) ? pickTraits.filter((x) => x !== tr) : [...pickTraits, tr];
				renderCreate();
			});
			function begin() { render(); connect(); }
			$('c-start').addEventListener('click', async () => {
				const btn = $('c-start') as HTMLButtonElement;
				const c = { id: 'p' + randId(15), key: randId(24) };
				const profile = { name: ($('c-name') as HTMLInputElement).value, avatar: pickAvatar, origin: pickOrigin, traits: pickTraits };
				btn.disabled = true;
				try {
					const { data } = await api({ action: 'create', id: c.id, key: c.key, profile });
					if (!data.ok) return toast(data.msg || '创建失败');
					cred = c;
					store.set(CRED_KEY, JSON.stringify(cred));
					if (adopt(data.state)) begin();
				} catch {
					toast('需要联网才能创建角色');
				} finally {
					btn.disabled = false;
				}
			});
			$('c-import').addEventListener('click', async () => {
				const m = /^([a-zA-Z0-9_-]{6,40})\.([a-zA-Z0-9]{16,64})$/.exec(($('c-code') as HTMLInputElement).value.trim());
				if (!m) return toast('同步码格式不对');
				try {
					const { data } = await api({ action: 'get', id: m[1], key: m[2] });
					if (!data.ok) return toast(data.msg || '恢复失败');
					cred = { id: m[1], key: m[2] };
					store.set(CRED_KEY, JSON.stringify(cred));
					if (adopt(data.state, '已恢复云端存档')) { render(); begin(); }
					else toast('云端存档已损坏');
				} catch { toast('网络错误，请稍后再试'); }
			});

			// ---------- 启动 ----------
			try { cred = JSON.parse(store.get(CRED_KEY) || 'null'); } catch {}
			try { state = sanitizeState(JSON.parse(store.get(SAVE_KEY) || 'null'), LOC_IDS); } catch {}
			if (!cred || !state || state.id !== cred.id) { state = null; cred = null; }
			renderCreate();
			render();
			fetch('/earth/cgi/manifest.json').then((r) => (r.ok ? r.json() : {})).then((m: any) => { cgi = m.images || {}; if (state) { renderPanel(); renderEvent(); } }).catch(() => {});
			if (state) { connect(); pullCloud(); }
			document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => { if (!document.hidden && state) { connect(); pullCloud(); } });
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
